==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*(j)ěsti}}, from {{etyl|ine-bsl-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-bsl-pro|*ēs-ti}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₁ed-||to eat}}. Cognates include Ancient Greek {{term|sc=polytonic|ἔδω|tr=edō|lang=grc}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|edō|lang=la}}, Sanskrit {{term|sc=Deva|अत्ति|tr=átti|lang=sa|}}, Lithuanian {{term|ė́sti||to eat (of animals), to swallow, to gobble|lang=lt}}, Hittite {{term|sc=Xsux|𒂊𒀉𒈪|tr=eidmi|lang=hit||I eat}}, Old English {{term|etan|lang=ang}} (English {{term|eat|lang=en}}).

